<?xml version="1.0" encoding="utf-8"?>
<usx version="3.0">
  <book code="2TI" style="id">- Ngoni Bible Version</book>
  <para style="h">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc1">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc2">2 Timoti</para>
  <para style="toc3">2 Tim</para>
  <para style="mt2">Balua ya pili ya Pauli kwa</para>
  <para style="mt1">Timoti</para>
  <para style="imt">Ulongolelu</para>
  <para style="ip">Chitabu cha 2 Timoti ndi balua ya pili kuhuma kwa mtumi Pauli kumyandikila muwuliwa waki Timoti. 2 Timoti yayandikwi papipi na mwishu wa Pauli kutama pamulima apa. Lukumbi lwenulo avili mchifungu kumuji wa Loma, 2 Timoti (musula ya 1:16). Pauli na Timoti vaganini neju hati lukumbi lwamahele Pauli amkemili Timoti mwana waki, Filimoni (musula ya 2:2; 1 Timoti musula ya 1:2, 1:18).</para>
  <para style="ip">Yeniyi ndi balua yimonga pagati ya balua mchehe za Pauli zeamyandikili mundu mwene pahala pa msambi wa vandu vevakumsadika Kilisitu. Balua zingi zidatu ndi 1 Timoti, na Tito, na Filimoni. Lukumbi balua iyi ya 2 Timoti pachayandikwi, vandu vevamsadika Kilisitu vevatamayi mukulongoswa na nkosi wa Loma vang'ahiswi neju. Yeniyi ndi chanzu cha Pauli kuvya muchifungu na avili akumlagazila Timoti akangamala mu mambu geginonopa. Ngati chayivili muchitabu cha 1 Timoti, Pauli akumbesa akotoka kuvayuwanila vawula vaudesi (1 Timoti, musula ya 1:16-18). Kavili Pauli amjovili Timoti kuvya kulongolo lubwela lukumbi lwa kung'ahika (musula ya 3:1).</para>
  <para style="iot">Gegavi</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli itumbula kwa kumjambusa Timoti, na kumkangamalisa mtima (musula ya 1:1-18).</para>
  <para style="io">Kangi Pauli akumuyupa Timoti akangamala, (musula ya 2:1-13).</para>
  <para style="io">Chechagelekili akampela malagizu ndava ya kutama kwa kumsadika Yesu (musula ya 2:14-26).</para>
  <para style="io">Kavili akumjovela ndava ya mambu gegihumila na kulongolo na chaiganikiwa kukita (musula ya 3:1-4:8).</para>
  <para style="io">Pauli imalasila kwa kumpela Timoti malagizu gaki mwene (musula ya 4:9-24).</para>
  <chapter number="1" style="c" sid="2TI 1" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 1:1" />Nene Pauli, ndi Chapanga aganili nivya na mtumi wa Kilisitu Yesu anitumili muni ndi niukokosa wumi wula weatilagazili mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu, <verse eid="2TI 1:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 1:2" />nikuyandikila veve Timoti mwana vangu mwenikuganili.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 1:2">Nikuvaganila ubwina wa Chapanga na lipyana na sadika kuhuma kwa Chapanga Dadi na Kilisitu Yesu Bambu witu.<verse eid="2TI 1:2" /></para>
  <para style="s">Kusengusa na malovi ga kukangamalisa mtima</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 1:3" />Nikumsengusa Chapanga mwanikumhengela kwa mtima weukulangisa kuvya uvi lepi na kubuda ngati chevakitili vagogo vangu, Nisengusa kila penikumbuka mukuyupa kwangu Chapanga kilu na muhi. <verse eid="2TI 1:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 1:4" />Nikumbuka maholi gaku na ninogela neju kukulola, muni nimemeswa luheku. <verse eid="2TI 1:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 1:5" />Niyimanyili sadika yako ya chakaka, sadika yaavili nayu chitengula chaku Loisi, na nyina waku Eunike. Nivi na uchakaka kuna na veve uvili nayu. <verse eid="2TI 1:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 1:6" />Ndi mana nikukumbusa uikohakesa njombi ya Chapanga yewapewili panakuvikili mawoko gangu. <verse eid="2TI 1:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 1:7" />Muni mpungu wetipewili na Chapanga lepi ndava ya kutikita tivya na wogoyi, lepi, ndi Mpungu waki weukutipela makakala na uganu na kujilongosa mwene.<verse eid="2TI 1:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 1:8" />Hinu, kotoka kuvya na soni kujova ndava ya Bambu witu, amala kotoka kuniwonela soni nene namfungwa ndava yaki. Nambu uvyai mu mang'ahiso ndava ya Linenu la Bwina, na ndava ya makakala gewipewa na Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 1:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 1:9" />Mwene atisangwili na kutikemela tivya tavandu vaki mwene, lepi ndava ya matendu gitu, ndi muni ndava ya mota yaki. Tapewili ngati cheigana mwene na kwa ubwina waki wa Yesu Kilisitu kwakona lukumbi, <verse eid="2TI 1:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 1:10" />nambu hinu ubwina wa Chapanga ugubukuliwi kubwela kwaki msangula witu Kilisitu Yesu. Adivalili makakala ga lifwa, na kwa njila ya Linenu la Bwina na akamanyisa wumi wangali lifwa.<verse eid="2TI 1:10" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 1:11" />Chapanga anihagwili nivyai namtumi na muwula wa kuvakokosela vandu Linenu la Bwina, <verse eid="2TI 1:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 1:12" />na ndava ya mambu genago naviniswi neju. Nambu nakona nikangamala ndava muni nimmanyili yula mwanimsadika, nivi na uchakaka yati akuchiyangalila mbaka ligono lila leiwuya Kilisitu. <verse eid="2TI 1:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 1:13" />Kamula kwa uchakaka mawuliwu gala genakuwulili na kusindimala musadika na uganu witu uwo muwungana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 1:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 1:14" />Kwa makakala ga Mpungu Msopi mweitama mumitima yitu, kamula mambu goha gabwina ganakugotolili.<verse eid="2TI 1:14" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 1:15" />Umanyili kuvya vandu voha va ku Asia vanilekili, pagati yavi ndi Fugelo na Helimogene. <verse eid="2TI 1:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 1:16" />Bambu uvahengela lipyana vandu va kaya ya Onesifolo, muni anikangamalisi mtima vamahele panavili mchifungu ndi akolili lepi soni, <verse eid="2TI 1:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 1:17" />nambu pahikili ndu ku Loma atumbwili kunilonda mbaka peaniweni. <verse eid="2TI 1:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 1:18" />Bambu amuhengela lipyana la Chapanga ligono ilo la kuhamuliwa! Na veve umanyili bwina gamahele geakitili ku Efeso.<verse eid="2TI 1:18" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 1" />
  <chapter number="2" style="c" sid="2TI 2" />
  <para style="s">Manjolinjoli vachakaka va Yesu Kilisitu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 2:1" />Hinu veve wamwana vangu, uvya na makakala muubwina wa Chapanga yetipata mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 2:2" />Tola mawuliwu gala gewayuwini nikokosa palongolo ya vandu vamahele vevagawene, ugagotola kwa vandu vevisadikika, vevihotola kuvawula vangi mewa.<verse eid="2TI 2:2" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 2:3" />Kangamala mukuviniswa pamonga na tete ngati manjolinjoli mchakaka wa Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 2:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 2:4" />Manjolinjoli peivya mungondo iyepa kukita lihengu lelivala wumi wa kila ligono muni kumganisa mkulu wa manjolinjoli. <verse eid="2TI 2:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 2:5" />Mjumbaji yoyoha nakuhotola kupewa njombi changali kujumba kulanda malagizu ga mikinu. <verse eid="2TI 2:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 2:6" />Mlimaji mwaihenga lihengu lelinonopa iganikiwa kupewa pahala pa kutumbula pa mabenu. <verse eid="2TI 2:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 2:7" />Holalela genago genijova, muni Bambu yati akuhotolesa umanya kila chindu.<verse eid="2TI 2:7" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 2:8" />Mkumbuka Yesu Kilisitu mwayukiswi kuhuma mulifwa, mwavili mu lukolo lwa Daudi, ngati chegijova Mayandiku ga Bwina genakokwisi, <verse eid="2TI 2:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 2:9" />ndi ndava ya kukokosa Linenu la Bwina nene nikungiwa minyololo ngati mundu muhakau. Nambu linenu la Chapanga likungiwa lepi minyololo. <verse eid="2TI 2:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 2:10" />Hinu ndi nisindimala mukila chindu ndava ya vandu vevahaguliwi na Chapanga, muni na vene vapata ugombozi kwa njila ya Yesu Kilisitu, na vevileta ukulu wa magono goha gangali mwishu. <verse eid="2TI 2:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 2:11" />Ujovo uwu ndi wachakaka,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">“Yikavyai tafwili pamonga na mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:11">ndi yati tivya mumi na mwene<verse eid="2TI 2:11" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 2:12" />Tisindimala,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Yati kulongosa na mwene,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">Tikambela,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:12">na mwene yati akutibela.<verse eid="2TI 2:12" /></para>
  <para style="q">
    <verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 2:13" />Ngati nakuvya vasadikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">mwene isigalila kuvya msadikika,</para>
  <para style="q" vid="2TI 2:13">muni nakuhotola kung'anamuka kwa gala geajovili.”<verse eid="2TI 2:13" /></para>
  <para style="s">Muhenga lihengu mwayidikiliwi na Chapanga</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 2:14" />Ndi, vakumbusa vandu vako mambu aga na kuvahakalila palongolo ya Chapanga valeka ndindani ndava ya malovi. Ndindani yeniyo nakuganikiwa ndi uvahalabisa veviyuwana. <verse eid="2TI 2:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 2:15" />Kangamala kujilangisa kuvya uyidikiliwi na Chapanga ngati muhenga lihengu mwangali soni mulihengu laki na mweiwula chakaka ujumbi wa chakaka wa Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 2:16" />Jivika patali na malovi gangaganikiwa gachihomela, muni genago gakuvavika vandu vavyai patali na Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 2:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 2:17" />Mawuliwu ngati ago ndi ngati lilonda lelikula na lelilya higa. Pagati ya vandu veviwula genago ndi Humenayo na Fileto. <verse eid="2TI 2:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 2:18" />Venava vayagili kutali na uchakaka, na kuyisopa sadika ya vandu vangi muwogoyi kwa vijova vandu vevafwili vamali kuyuka. <verse eid="2TI 2:18" /><verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 2:19" />Nambu mkingisa weutimiliki wewavikiwi na Chapanga usindimala, na panani yaki payandikwi malovi “Bambu avamanyili vandu vevavili vaki” Na “Kila mwaijova mwene ndi wa Bambu ndi aleka uhakau.”<verse eid="2TI 2:19" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 2:20" />Munyumba yivaha gavili mankeve ga kila namuna gangi ga zahabu na mashonga, gangi ga ludaka vingi vya mikongo, na vingi vya lihengu la utopesa na hingi ndava ya lihengu la kila ligono. <verse eid="2TI 2:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 2:21" />Hinu ngati mundu akujinyambisa kwa kujivika patali na mambu gahakau, yati ivya chindu cha lihengu lene, muni ahaguliwi ndava ya kumhengela Bambu waki na ajitendekili kwa lihengu loloha la bwina. <verse eid="2TI 2:21" /><verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 2:22" />Jivika patali na mnogo wa usongolo, landa gegavi gabwina palongolo ya Bambu na sadika na uganu na uteke, pamonga na vandu voha vevakumuyupa Bambu kwa mtima wabwina. <verse eid="2TI 2:22" /><verse number="23" style="v" sid="2TI 2:23" />Yepa ndindani ya uhomela na chiyimu, umanyili kuvya ago gileta ngondo. <verse eid="2TI 2:23" /><verse number="24" style="v" sid="2TI 2:24" />Mtumisi wa Bambu akotoka kutovana. Iganikiwa kuvya mngolongondi kwa vandu voha, muwula wabwina na mweisindimala, <verse eid="2TI 2:24" /><verse number="25" style="v" sid="2TI 2:25" />ndi mpoli peakuvahakalila vevakumbela, pangi Chapanga akuvapela fwasi ya kuleka kwavi kumbudila Chapanga, na kuumanya uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 2:25" /><verse number="26" style="v" sid="2TI 2:26" />Penapo luhala lwavi yati lukuvawuyila kavili, vakalema mulikoka la Setani mwavayonjwili na kuvakita vayidakila gala geigana mwene.<verse eid="2TI 2:26" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 2" />
  <chapter number="3" style="c" sid="2TI 3" />
  <para style="s">Magono gamwishu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 3:1" />Mmanya kuvya magono ga mwishu yati kwivya na mang'ahiso. <verse eid="2TI 3:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 3:2" />Muni vandu yati vakujiganisa vene, vevana mnogo wa mashonga, vevimeka, vevakujilola, vevakumliga Chapanga, vangavayuwanila vanyina na vadadi vavi, vangasengusa na vahakau. <verse eid="2TI 3:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 3:3" />Yati vihumila vandu vanga uganu mumtima na vanga lipyana na vakulukisaji, vahutulu na vanaligoga, yati vibela chochoha chabwina, <verse eid="2TI 3:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 3:4" />yati vivya vevakuvang'anamukila vayavi na vana ndindani na vevamemili umeka na vevigana mnogo wa vindu kuliku kumgana Chapanga. <verse eid="2TI 3:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 3:5" />Cha kuvala yati viloleka ngati vakumlumba Chapanga, nambu yati vagabela makakala gaki. Jivika patali na vandu ngati venavo. <verse eid="2TI 3:5" /><verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 3:6" />Vangi vihamba munyumba za vandu na kuvakonga vadala vangolongondi vevibudingana neju muni vavayuwanila vene. Vadala venavo vakumbudila neju Chapanga na vamemili minogu yihaku ya kila namuna, <verse eid="2TI 3:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 3:7" />vadala vevilinga kujiwula magono goha nambu nakuhotola kuhikila umanya wenuo wa uchakaka. <verse eid="2TI 3:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 3:8" />Vandu venavo vakuubela uchakaka ngati Yane na Yambule chevambelili Musa. Maholo ga vandu gayagili, na sadika ya udesi. <verse eid="2TI 3:8" /><verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 3:9" />Nambu nakuhotola kuyendelela neju ndava muni uyimu wavi yati ulolekana kwa vandu voha. Ndi chayavili kwa Yane na Yamble.<verse eid="2TI 3:9" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu ga kumalikisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 3:10" />Nambu veve, ugalandili mawuliwu gangu, kutama kwangu, mambu genaganikiwi kuhenga mukutama, sadika yangu, kukangamala kwangu, uganu wangu, ulindila wangu, <verse eid="2TI 3:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 3:11" />mang'ahiso gangu na kuviniswa. Ugamanyili mambu geganikolili Antiokia na Ikonio na Lusitila. Nakangamili mang'ahiso gavaha, nambu Bambu anisangwili mu mambu goha ago. <verse eid="2TI 3:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 3:12" />Kila mundu mweigana kutama cha kumuyupa Chapanga mukuwungana na Kilisitu Yesu ndi yiganikiwa ang'aiswa. <verse eid="2TI 3:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 3:13" />Vandu vahakau na vevijova udesi ndava yaki viyendelela kuvya vahakau, vakakonga vandu vangi na vene vikongewa. <verse eid="2TI 3:13" /><verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 3:14" />Nambu veve sindimala muuchakaka weuwuliwi ukauyidakila neju. Uvamanyili vala vevavili vawuliwa vaku, <verse eid="2TI 3:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 3:15" />ukumbuka kuhumila wana waku ugamanyili Mayandiku Gamsopi ndi gegihotola kukupela luhala lweluleta usangula mu njila ya kumsadika Kilisitu Yesu. <verse eid="2TI 3:15" /><verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 3:16" />Mayandiku Gamsopi goha gayandikwi kwa ulongosi wa Chapanga ndi gabwina kwa kuwula uchakaka, kuhakalila, kuvika bwina gegabudiwi, na kuvalongosa vandu vatama kwa kumganisa Chapanga, <verse eid="2TI 3:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 3:17" />muni mundu mwakumhengela Chapanga avya mweahotwiswi mukila lijambu na ajitendekela neju kukita kila lihengu la bwina.<verse eid="2TI 3:17" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 3" />
  <chapter number="4" style="c" sid="2TI 4" />
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="1" style="v" sid="2TI 4:1" />Nikulagiza palongolo ya Chapanga na Kilisitu Yesu mwakuvahamula vandu vevavili mumi na vevafwili, na ndava ibwela kulongosa ngati Nkosi, <verse eid="2TI 4:1" /><verse number="2" style="v" sid="2TI 4:2" />kokosa Linenu la Bwina lukumbi vandu vigana amala vigana lepi, lukumbi lweluganikiwa na lwangaganikiwa, ywanga, hakalila, na kangamalisa vandu kwa kuwula kwa usindimala woha. <verse eid="2TI 4:2" /><verse number="3" style="v" sid="2TI 4:3" />Yati lubwela lukumbi vandu nakuyuwanila mawuliwu ga chakaka, ndi yati vilanda mnogo wavi vene kujilondela vawula ago vevakuvajovela mambu gevigana kuyuwana kwa mumakutu gavi gegituguta. <verse eid="2TI 4:3" /><verse number="4" style="v" sid="2TI 4:4" />Yati vibela kuyuwana uchakaka, yati ving'anamkila majovo ga udesi. <verse eid="2TI 4:4" /><verse number="5" style="v" sid="2TI 4:5" />Nambu veve, uvya mihu mukila hali, sindimala mang'ahiso henga lihengu la ukokosa wa Linenu la Bwina, henga cheuganikiwa mulihengu laku la kumhengela Chapanga.<verse eid="2TI 4:5" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="6" style="v" sid="2TI 4:6" />Kwa upandi wangu nene, nivili papipi kuwusiwa luteta na lukumbi lwa kufwa kwangu kuhikili. <verse eid="2TI 4:6" /><verse number="7" style="v" sid="2TI 4:7" />Nitovini ngondo bwina, nijumbili mbaka mwishu wa kujumba kwangu, niyilindi sadika yangu. <verse eid="2TI 4:7" /><verse number="8" style="v" sid="2TI 4:8" />Ndi hinu yisigalili ndu kupewa njombi ya uhotola ndi Chapanga vavikili vala vandu vaki, ndi njombi Bambu, mweihamula ngati cheyiganikiwa, yati akunipela ligono lila, nambu lepi nene ndu, ndi na vala voha vevilolela kwa uganu kuhumila kwaki.<verse eid="2TI 4:8" /></para>
  <para style="s">Malagizu</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="9" style="v" sid="2TI 4:9" />Ukangamala kanyata kubwela kwa nene. <verse eid="2TI 4:9" /><verse number="10" style="v" sid="2TI 4:10" />Dema aganili mambu ga pamulima apa anilekili na kuhamba Tesalonike. Kilesike ahambili Galatia na Tito ahambili Dalimatia. <verse eid="2TI 4:10" /><verse number="11" style="v" sid="2TI 4:11" />Ndi Luka mwene mweavili apa pamonga na nene. Mtola Maluko umbwela nayu, muni yati ihotola kunitangatila lihengu langu. <verse eid="2TI 4:11" /><verse number="12" style="v" sid="2TI 4:12" />Namtumili Tukiko ku Efeso kula. <verse eid="2TI 4:12" /><verse number="13" style="v" sid="2TI 4:13" />Peubwela niletela likoti langu lenalekili kwa Kalipo ku Tloa, niletela na hitabu na neju hila ya chikumba.<verse eid="2TI 4:13" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="14" style="v" sid="2TI 4:14" />Yula mweitengeneza vindu vya mashonga gamahele liina laki Alekizanda anikitili uhakau wamahele, Bambu Chapanga yati akumlipisa kulandana na matendu gaki. <verse eid="2TI 4:14" /><verse number="15" style="v" sid="2TI 4:15" />Jiyangalila nayu muni aubelili ujumbi witu kwa ligoga neju.<verse eid="2TI 4:15" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="16" style="v" sid="2TI 4:16" />Lukumbi penajikengelela mu libanji kawaka mundu mwayimili upandi wangu, voha vanilekili. Chapanga akotoka kuvavalangila kubuda uko! <verse eid="2TI 4:16" /><verse number="17" style="v" sid="2TI 4:17" />Nambu Bambu atamili pamonga na nene, anipelili makakala, na kuhotola kukokosa ujumbi woha, vandu vangalikuvya Vayawudi vauyuwana, kavili na sanguliwi kuhumua mulifwa ngati mumlomo wa lihimba. <verse eid="2TI 4:17" /><verse number="18" style="v" sid="2TI 4:18" />Bambu yati akunisangula mu mambu goha gahakau, na kunitola mbaka muunkosi waki wa kunani. Kwaki uvya ukulu magono goha gangali mwishu! Ena.<verse eid="2TI 4:18" /></para>
  <para style="s">Jambusa ya kumalikisila</para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="19" style="v" sid="2TI 4:19" />Vajambusa Plisika na Akula, pamonga na vandu va nyumba ya Onesifolo. <verse eid="2TI 4:19" /><verse number="20" style="v" sid="2TI 4:20" />Elasito asigalili Kolinto na Tofimo namlekili Mileto ndava muni avili na utamu. <verse eid="2TI 4:20" /><verse number="21" style="v" sid="2TI 4:21" />Kita kanyata kubwela kwakona lukumbi lwa mbepu.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:21">Ebulo, Pude, Lino na Klaudia vakuvajambusa, mewawa valongo vangi voha.<verse eid="2TI 4:21" /></para>
  <para style="p">
    <verse number="22" style="v" sid="2TI 4:22" />Bambu avya na veve mumpungu waku.</para>
  <para style="p" vid="2TI 4:22">Nikuvaganila ubwina wa Chapanga mwavoha.<verse eid="2TI 4:22" /></para>
  <chapter eid="2TI 4" />
</usx>